{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24896","headline":"赋得月照冰池 · 叶季良","name":"赋得月照冰池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霁夕云初歛，栖娥月未亏。\n圆光生碧海，素色满瑶池。\n天迥轮空见，波凝影讵窥。\n浮霜玉比彩，照像镜同规。\n皎洁寒偏净，裴回夜转宜。\n谁怜幽境在，长与赏心随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"叶季良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}